name: Failed taint review keeps structural candidates without completing Scan
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_hunt_outcomes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/unbound-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 PREREQUISITE PLAN | unbound-prerequisite
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_hunt_outcomes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unbound
paste-file: @ART/approval-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance
expect: Total provider calls: 3
expect: Protected review calls: 1
keys: End y
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | approved
paste-file: @ART/invalid-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 PREREQUISITE PLAN | approved-prerequisite
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 Model review failed | failed-model-review
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_hunt_outcomes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART failed
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | failed-result
expect: Model review failed. Scan is incomplete.
expect: Retained structural candidates: 1
expect: unavailable
resize: 160x48
live-snap: failed-result-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: failed-result-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: failed-result-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: failed-result-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | failed-result-40x12
expect: failed
keys: NPage
live-snap: failed-notice-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | failed-tail-40x12
ask: Does failed model review remain distinct from the explicitly retained unverified structural candidate, with readable failure and cost uncertainty at all six sizes?
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Receipt | failed-receipt-40x12
resize: 120x36
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/exhausted-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 PREREQUISITE PLAN | exhausted-prerequisite
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 allowance exhausted: 2 calls committed | exhausted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_hunt_outcomes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exhausted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 2/3 | restarted-accounting
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_hunt_outcomes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | restarted-result
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | restarted-result-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: restarted-notice-40x12
ask: Does restart retain a failed attempt, one unverified candidate and two settled Discovery calls, while protected Review and further work remain unapproved?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
